{"timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:09:37.469605+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "provider_response", "message": "Taiji API response (streaming)", "request_id": "3aefd1f0-ba39-4307-a9bf-68d8efd33384", "latency_ms": 9026.67, "total_content_length": 123, "total_reasoning_length": 454, "has_tools": true, "parsed_tool_calls_count": 1, "total_content_preview": "<tool_calls><invokename=\"terminal\"><parametername=\"command\">whichcurl||echo\"curlnotfound\"</parameter></invoke></tool_calls>", "total_reasoning_preview": "我得先确认 curl 是否可用，因为两次都报 \"No such file or directory\"。这可能是 curl 没安装，或者路径有问题。我可以尝试用 which curl 检查，或者直接用 wget 或 Python 脚本。为了效率，我先检查 curl 的路径，同时如果不可用，可以用 Python 的 requests 来获取天气。考虑到用户偏好数据准确性，我也可以考虑使用专业的天气 API 或更可靠的服务。不过 wttr.in 通常是一个简单易用的服务，刚才的错误很可能是 curl 没有正确安装或环境变量问题。我会先尝试用 which 检查 curl，如果不存在，就尝试通过 Python 的 urllib 或 requests 获取。但为了简洁和快速，我可以直接尝试用 python3 的 urllib 来获取天气数据。\n\n由于我需要先确保工具可用，我可以使用 terminal 命令先检查 curl 是否存在，然后决定下一步。\n\n我先执行 which curl 或 type curl。", "content_buffer_size": 39, "tool_call_detected": true}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:09:37.469747+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "raw_response", "message": "Outgoing response (streaming)", "request_id": "3aefd1f0-ba39-4307-a9bf-68d8efd33384", "total_chunks": 200, "chunks_preview": ["{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-23d9785222e4\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724568,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"reasoning_content\":\" 我得\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-23d9785222e4\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724568,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\"先\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-23d9785222e4\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724568,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\"确认\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-23d9785222e4\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724568,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\" curl\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-23d9785222e4\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724568,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\" \"}}]}"]}
