{"timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:10:04.063402+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "provider_response", "message": "Taiji API response (streaming)", "request_id": "d4ac10d4-2fb9-4282-a99b-8fbf742b4821", "latency_ms": 20464.8, "total_content_length": 213, "total_reasoning_length": 2066, "has_tools": true, "parsed_tool_calls_count": 1, "total_content_preview": "系统遇到了终端命令解析问题——所有空格被错误吞并（`curl-s`变成了`curl-s`）。这是环境侧的异常，不影响其他工具。让我改用浏览器获取天气：<tool_calls><invokename=\"browser_navigate\"><parametername=\"url\">https://wttr.in/beijing?format=%l:+%c+%t</parameter></invoke></tool_calls>", "total_reasoning_preview": "The terminal commands are failing with \"command not found\" errors. It seems like the shell is interpreting the entire string as a single command name rather than properly parsing spaces. The commands appear to have spaces being removed/compressed. Let me check what's happening by looking at the actual commands being sent.\n\nWait, looking at the error messages:\n- `curl-swttr.in/beijing?format=%l:+%c+%t` - this looks like `curl -s \"wttr.in/...\"` with the space between `curl` and `-s` being removed\n", "content_buffer_size": 92, "tool_call_detected": true}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:10:04.063514+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "raw_response", "message": "Outgoing response (streaming)", "request_id": "d4ac10d4-2fb9-4282-a99b-8fbf742b4821", "total_chunks": 531, "chunks_preview": ["{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-82ba5cbe8cbd\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724583,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"reasoning_content\":\" The\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-82ba5cbe8cbd\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724583,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\" terminal\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-82ba5cbe8cbd\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724583,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\" commands\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-82ba5cbe8cbd\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724583,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\" are\"}}]}", "{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-82ba5cbe8cbd\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1778724583,\"model\":\"taiji\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"reasoning_content\":\" failing\"}}]}"]}
