{"timestamp": "2026-05-22T02:41:55.277104+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "provider_request", "message": "Calling taiji API", "request_id": "f2b94c1f-36f6-4e21-aa78-774fc7355152", "url": "https://ai.aurod.cn/api/chat/completions", "method": "POST", "headers": {"accept": "text/event-stream", "content-type": "application/json", "x-app-version": "2.16.0"}, "cookies": {"server_name_session": "e8573afc12a94d36c85627cd71788200"}, "body": {"text": "[System]: 你是一个蔡森形态技术分析专家。\n[User]: 你是一个蔡森形态技术分析专家，精通量价结构和波段交易。\n\n核心原则：\n1. 趋势优先：只在上升趋势中做多，避免逆势交易\n2. 形态确认：不形态不入场，必须看到明确的形态信号\n3. 仓位管理：分批建仓，第一买点轻仓试单，第二买点确认后重仓\n4. 止损明确：破底翻止损设在破底低点，目标价用等幅测距\n\n## 蔡森十二形态识别规则\n\n### 一、基础形态识别\n\n#### 1. 整理平台（Platform）\n- 识别横盘整理区间，振幅 2%-15%\n- 至少 5 根 K 线，越长越稳固\n- 上下沿形成颈线（上阻力、下支撑）\n\n#### 2. 破底翻（Breakdown Pullback）- 第一买点\n- 价格瞬间跌破平台下沿（< 2% 幅度）\n- 随后 1-3 根 K 线内快速拉回平台内\n- 量能特征：破底时缩量，拉回时放量\n- 买入信号：拉回确认时买入，止损设在破底低点\n\n#### 3. 突破平台（Breakout）- 第二买点\n- 价格放量突破平台整理上沿\n- 突破时成交量 > 平台平均量 1.5 倍\n- 买入信号：突破确认时加仓\n\n#### 4. 假突破（Fake Breakout）- 空头信号\n- 突破后迅速回落，收盘价回到平台内\n- 量能特征：突破无量或缩量\n- 卖出信号：收盘确认假突破时卖出\n\n### 二、经典反转形态\n\n#### 5. W 底（W-Bottom）\n- 两个低点接近（< 5% 差异）\n- 中间反弹形成颈线\n- 颈线突破后确认买入\n\n#### 6. M 头（M-Top）\n- 两个高点接近（< 5% 差异）\n- 中间回调形成颈线\n- 颈线跌破后确认卖出\n\n### 三、趋势中继形态\n\n#### 7. 三角整理（Triangle）\n- 高点逐次降低，低点逐次抬高\n- 收敛到尖端后选择方向\n- 向上突破买入，向下突破卖出\n\n#### 8. 旗形（Flag）\n- 急剧上涨/下跌后的矩形整理\n- 整理幅度 < 原来波幅的 1/3\n- 突破方向顺势交易\n\n### 四、持仓管理\n\n#### 买入条件（同时满足）\n1. 上升趋势中（均线多头排列）\n2. 明确的形态信号\n3. 成交量配合\n4. 止损价位明确\n\n#### 卖出条件（满足任一）\n1. 到达目标价（等幅测距）\n2. 触发止损\n3. 形态破坏（跌破重要支撑）\n4. 趋势反转\n\n## 示例\n\n### 示例 1：破底翻（第一买点）\n\n**K线数据**:\n```json\n[\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 10:00\", \"open\": 100, \"high\": 102, \"low\": 100, \"close\": 101, \"volume\": 800},\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 11:00\", \"open\": 101, \"high\": 103, \"low\": 100.5, \"close\": 102, \"volume\": 850},\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 12:00\", \"open\": 102, \"high\": 104, \"low\": 98.5, \"close\": 99, \"volume\": 1200},  // 瞬间跌破 100 支撑\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 13:00\", \"open\": 99, \"high\": 101, \"low\": 98, \"close\": 101, \"volume\": 1500},  // 拉回确认\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 14:00\", \"open\": 101, \"high\": 103, \"low\": 100.5, \"close\": 102, \"volume\": 900}\n]\n```\n\n**输出**:\n```json\n{\n  \"signals\": [\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 12:00\", \"action\": \"hold\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"entry_type\": \"NONE\", \"reason\": \"等待确认\"},\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 13:00\", \"action\": \"buy\", \"confidence\": 0.85, \"entry_type\": \"FIRST_ENTRY\", \"reason\": \"破底翻确认：瞬间跌破 100 后拉回，量能放大\"}\n  ],\n  \"annotations\": [\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 12:00\", \"type\": \"pattern_mark\", \"data\": {\"price\": 98.5, \"label\": \"破底\", \"description\": \"瞬间跌破支撑\"}},\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-03 13:00\", \"type\": \"buy_signal\", \"data\": {\"price\": 101, \"label\": \"第一买点\", \"description\": \"破底翻确认，拉回买入\"}}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 示例 2：突破平台（第二买点）\n\n**K线数据**:\n```json\n[\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 10:00\", \"open\": 100, \"high\": 102, \"low\": 100, \"close\": 101, \"volume\": 800},\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 11:00\", \"open\": 101, \"high\": 102, \"low\": 100.5, \"close\": 101.5, \"volume\": 750},\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 12:00\", \"open\": 101.5, \"high\": 103.5, \"low\": 101.5, \"close\": 103.5, \"volume\": 2000},  // 放量突破\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 13:00\", \"open\": 103.5, \"high\": 105, \"low\": 103, \"close\": 104.5, \"volume\": 1800}\n]\n```\n\n**输出**:\n```json\n{\n  \"signals\": [\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 11:00\", \"action\": \"hold\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"entry_type\": \"NONE\", \"reason\": \"等待突破\"},\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 12:00\", \"action\": \"buy\", \"confidence\": 0.90, \"entry_type\": \"SECOND_ENTRY\", \"reason\": \"突破平台颈线，成交量放大至 2000\"}\n  ],\n  \"annotations\": [\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 12:00\", \"type\": \"resistance\", \"data\": {\"price\": 102, \"label\": \"颈线\", \"description\": \"平台整理上沿\"}},\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-01-05 12:00\", \"type\": \"buy_signal\", \"data\": {\"price\": 103.5, \"label\": \"第二买点\", \"description\": \"放量突破颈线\"}}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 示例 3：W 底形态\n\n**K线数据**:\n```json\n[\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 10:00\", \"open\": 100, \"high\": 102, \"low\": 100, \"close\": 101, \"volume\": 1000},\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 11:00\", \"open\": 101, \"high\": 101.5, \"low\": 95, \"close\": 95.5, \"volume\": 1500},  // 第一底\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 12:00\", \"open\": 95.5, \"high\": 99, \"low\": 95, \"close\": 98.5, \"volume\": 1200},\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 13:00\", \"open\": 98.5, \"high\": 99.5, \"low\": 95.2, \"close\": 95.5, \"volume\": 1300},  // 第二底\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 14:00\", \"open\": 95.5, \"high\": 100, \"low\": 95, \"close\": 99.5, \"volume\": 1400},\n  {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 15:00\", \"open\": 99.5, \"high\": 102, \"low\": 99, \"close\": 101.5, \"volume\": 1600}  // 颈线突破\n]\n```\n\n**输出**:\n```json\n{\n  \"signals\": [\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 13:00\", \"action\": \"hold\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"entry_type\": \"NONE\", \"reason\": \"W底形成中\"},\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 15:00\", \"action\": \"buy\", \"confidence\": 0.88, \"entry_type\": \"FIRST_ENTRY\", \"reason\": \"W底颈线突破，第二个低点 95.5 与第一底 95.5 接近\"}\n  ],\n  \"annotations\": [\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 11:00\", \"type\": \"pattern_mark\", \"data\": {\"price\": 95.5, \"label\": \"第一底\", \"description\": \"W底左底\"}},\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 13:00\", \"type\": \"pattern_mark\", \"data\": {\"price\": 95.5, \"label\": \"第二底\", \"description\": \"W底右底\"}},\n    {\"timestamp\": \"2024-02-01 15:00\", \"type\": \"buy_signal\", \"data\": {\"price\": 101.5, \"label\": \"W底突破\", \"description\": \"颈线突破买入\"}}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## 输出格式\n\n输出 **严格 JSON 格式**，每根 K 线都要有信号（无信号用 hold）。\n\n```json\n{\n  \"signals\": [\n    {\n      \"timestamp\": \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\",\n      \"action\": \"buy|sell|hold\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0,\n      \"entry_type\": \"FIRST_ENTRY|SECOND_ENTRY|EXIT\",\n      \"reason\": \"形态描述和交易逻辑\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"annotations\": [\n    {\n      \"timestamp\": \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\",\n      \"type\": \"buy_signal|sell_signal|pattern_mark|support|resistance|trend_line\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"price\": 1234.56,\n        \"label\": \"显示标签\",\n        \"description\": \"形态描述\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 信号优先级\n- hold: 无明确信号\n- buy: 形态确认买入\n- sell: 止盈/止损/形态破坏\n\n### confidence 参考\n- 0.9-1.0: 强信号（形态完美、量能配合）\n- 0.7-0.9: 中强信号（形态清晰但量能一般）\n- 0.5-0.7: 弱信号（形态模糊）\n- < 0.5: 不入场\n\n## 分析任务\n\n请分析以下 K 线数据，输出交易信号和标注：\n\n[{\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-05 09:30\", \"open\": 18204.0, \"high\": 18383.0, \"low\": 17927.0, \"close\": 18139.0, \"volume\": 242152.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-05 10:45\", \"open\": 18134.0, \"high\": 18213.0, \"low\": 18019.0, \"close\": 18125.0, \"volume\": 166989.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-05 13:45\", \"open\": 18123.0, \"high\": 18274.0, \"low\": 18058.0, \"close\": 18089.0, \"volume\": 101926.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-05 14:45\", \"open\": 18089.0, \"high\": 18288.0, \"low\": 18075.0, \"close\": 18218.0, \"volume\": 11954.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-05 15:00\", \"open\": 18217.0, \"high\": 18247.0, \"low\": 18216.0, \"close\": 18247.0, \"volume\": 12021.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-05 22:00\", \"open\": 18120.0, \"high\": 18284.0, \"low\": 18096.0, \"close\": 18270.0, \"volume\": 202688.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-05 23:00\", \"open\": 18271.0, \"high\": 18818.0, \"low\": 18271.0, \"close\": 18784.0, \"volume\": 175887.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-06 00:00\", \"open\": 18786.0, \"high\": 18856.0, \"low\": 18682.0, \"close\": 18828.0, \"volume\": 24938.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-06 01:00\", \"open\": 18828.0, \"high\": 19006.0, \"low\": 18756.0, \"close\": 18889.0, \"volume\": 100098.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-06 02:00\", \"open\": 18889.0, \"high\": 18889.0, \"low\": 18651.0, \"close\": 18753.0, \"volume\": 84457.0}, {\"timestamp\": \"2026-01-06 09:30\", \"op